        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "dbe3e355-654f-3302-afc4-0dba15b0eace",
                "word": "transmutation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "10c8adcd-0e22-4f5c-aaed-5844d1cccf98",
                        "entry_id": "dbe3e355-654f-3302-afc4-0dba15b0eace",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "transmutations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a3d49d26-9224-3e38-9c04-8bcff9c563ad",
                        "entry_id": "dbe3e355-654f-3302-afc4-0dba15b0eace",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Changement d’une chose en une autre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ed9cbc3-bde2-4f62-86d7-f1bdea32dd63",
                                "sense_id": "a3d49d26-9224-3e38-9c04-8bcff9c563ad",
                                "text": "Le plus étonnant est sans doute l'aisance avec laquelle saint Albert accepte les idées des anciens à propos de la transmutation des plantes. c'est ainsi qu'il considère le gui comme résultant de la transpiration de la sève de l'arbre qui le porte, […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fd019b61-4bf5-30f3-979f-54452360f9b4",
                        "entry_id": "dbe3e355-654f-3302-afc4-0dba15b0eace",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Changement d’une chose en une autre.",
                            "Changement d’une substance en une autre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9db314fd-c69d-4921-b87f-693cf1e83611",
                                "sense_id": "fd019b61-4bf5-30f3-979f-54452360f9b4",
                                "text": "La transmutation des métaux en or était l’objet des recherches des alchimistes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "16dac830-6f72-3468-ace3-91b9a7d96c36",
                        "entry_id": "dbe3e355-654f-3302-afc4-0dba15b0eace",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Changement d’un atome en un autre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially",
                            "physical"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9dafe160-91f0-3cdf-82d9-8e6e6ea60591",
                        "entry_id": "dbe3e355-654f-3302-afc4-0dba15b0eace",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Changement d’un atome en un autre.",
                            "Transformation d’un nucléide en un autre par réaction nucléaire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially",
                            "physical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1335f52b-62cb-46b6-b798-5cf5126dc758",
                                "sense_id": "9dafe160-91f0-3cdf-82d9-8e6e6ea60591",
                                "text": "La transmutation d'un atome (ou élément) en un autre est une modification de son noyau atomique."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ebef54a9-bbb3-307e-af1a-387abe51cb67",
                        "entry_id": "dbe3e355-654f-3302-afc4-0dba15b0eace",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Transformation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0de972a-79a7-443c-8823-454ea46122ce",
                                "sense_id": "ebef54a9-bbb3-307e-af1a-387abe51cb67",
                                "text": "La grande question est aujourd’hui celle-ci : que nous arrive-t-il ? Nous sommes les sujets, non point d’une « maladie », au sens clinique du terme, mais d’une formidable transmutation de l’aventure humaine, une révolution ou une « bifurcation » fondamentale, pour reprendre l’expression du prix Nobel de chimie Ilya Prigogine."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "29eaff53-5dba-4e32-b24b-7ef2ec7ffec8",
                        "source_entry_id": "dbe3e355-654f-3302-afc4-0dba15b0eace",
                        "target_lang_word": "transmutation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "transmutation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2135e47-7784-3607-973c-50022ad105c2",
                                        "entry_id": "93870f5a-5ef2-3491-98be-be0c5ecbb041",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Change, alteration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b4b691e-9304-3810-aae1-a7b72b518dbc",
                                        "entry_id": "93870f5a-5ef2-3491-98be-be0c5ecbb041",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The conversion of one thing into something else; transformation.",
                                            "The supposed transformation of one element into another, especially of a base metal into gold."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e458e632-8803-456a-b94d-61d7831295cd",
                                                "sense_id": "4b4b691e-9304-3810-aae1-a7b72b518dbc",
                                                "text": "The transmutation of metals was secondary to the main aim, which was the spiritual transformation of the adept."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1243e309-cad0-30a0-bd6b-b707e2082913",
                                        "entry_id": "93870f5a-5ef2-3491-98be-be0c5ecbb041",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The conversion of one thing into something else; transformation.",
                                            "The actual transformation of one element into another by a nuclear reaction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f847a12-56fd-4741-ab9d-638d1de6498e",
                                                "sense_id": "1243e309-cad0-30a0-bd6b-b707e2082913",
                                                "text": "Years later, scientists learned that the sun’s light—visible and invisible—is merely the by-product of a process alchemists had vainly tried to reproduce for centuries—the transmutation of one element into another. That nature accomplishes this before our very eyes, and that it is what creates the solar heat and light that supports all life, was suspected by no one. The revelation came as a complete surprise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
